  <dialog id="importDialog"><form method="dialog"><div class="dialog-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">BRING YOUR BOOKMARKS IN</p><h2>Import bookmarks</h2></div><button class="icon-button" value="cancel" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><div id="importChoose"><p>Choose a browser bookmark HTML file or a Kept full backup. Nothing changes until you review and confirm.</p><label class="file-picker">Choose file<input id="importFile" type="file" accept=".html,.htm,.json"></label></div><div id="importPreview" hidden></div><p class="field-error" id="importError"></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button value="cancel" class="secondary">Cancel</button><button type="button" id="importCommit" class="primary" hidden>Import bookmarks</button></div></form></dialog>

